| Capability | C++17-C++23 | C++26 |
|---|---|---|
| Bind every element by name | ✅ | ✅ |
| Bind a subset + "rest" as a pack | ❌ | ✅ (`[first, ...rest]`) |
| `static` structured binding | ❌ | ✅ |
| `thread_local` structured binding | ❌ | ✅ |

